  {
    "id": "6855721",
    "original": "湿地帯は生態系において水の浄化、洪水と侵食の防止、野生生物への食料とすみかの提供という重要な役割を演じる。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "6696016",
        "text": "Wetland habitats serve essential functions in an ecosystem, including acting as water filters, providing flood and erosion control, and furnishing food and homes for fish and wildlife."
